# A call whose picked choice is long: Go with names it on one line, cut short inside the button.
stage 1440 900
window 1440 900
prefer themeId aura-noir
prefer starAsked true
replies call-follow-up.json
project storefront shop
chat Wren
title "Cache the product pages"
say "question {\"questions\":[{\"question\":\"What should the product page do until its cache is warm?\",\"header\":\"Cold cache\",\"options\":[{\"label\":\"Serve the page straight from the database with a clear banner saying prices may lag, and warm the cache in the background for the next visitor\",\"description\":\"Nobody waits, a few visitors see the banner\"},{\"label\":\"Hold the request until the cache is warm\",\"description\":\"Slower first visit, never stale\"}]}]}"
settle 8
front Wren
settle 2
click "What should the product page do until its cache is warm?"
settle 2
click 900,245
settle 2
zoom 912,300 1.9
settle 1
snap calls-long-choice
